Title: biPOD
Version: 0.99.0
Authors@R: 
    person("Giovanni", "Santacatterina", , "santacatterinagiovanni@gmail.com", role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: Bayesian inference of kinetic parameters (growth rates, birth time,
    change points) from time-series population count data, using Stan via 'cmdstanr'
    for MCMC and variational inference with model selection via LOO-IC or BIC.
